    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "160e3ea99eeea5a5be77": "Burninate's the name, smithin's my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?",
        "ac96f1f8751006eed9a1": "You've done all that I've asked you to do, $n. There's really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.$B$BFarewell!",
        "d676bab4b4ce3f9e75ad": "I wish to browse your wares."
      },
      "name": "Master Smith Burninate",
      "subName": "The Thorium Brotherhood",
      "translationMetadata": {
